# whitelist: only small text knowledge is shared; binaries, data, transcripts and secrets stay local
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!*.md
!*.txt
!*.json
!*.sh
!*.py
!*.patch
!*.yml
!secrets.tar.enc
# transcripts never sync (2026-10-18 secret leak)

# never sync transcripts or PC project dumps
local-pc/projects/
*.jsonl
